1
00:00:33,533 --> 00:00:34,409
<c.simplifiedchinese>（诚）</c.simplifiedchinese>

2
00:00:42,876 --> 00:00:44,043
<c.simplifiedchinese>（诚）</c.simplifiedchinese>

3
00:00:44,836 --> 00:00:46,588
<c.simplifiedchinese>不必担心</c.simplifiedchinese>

4
00:00:47,088 --> 00:00:50,842
<c.simplifiedchinese>毕竟 我是新选组第一小队的队长</c.simplifiedchinese>

5
00:00:50,925 --> 00:00:54,095
<c.simplifiedchinese>你以为我不知道你有肺病吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

6
00:00:55,764 --> 00:00:57,724
<c.simplifiedchinese>我来解决他</c.simplifiedchinese>

7
00:01:12,155 --> 00:01:16,618
<c.simplifiedchinese>新选组第三小队队长斋藤一</c.simplifiedchinese>

8
00:01:18,036 --> 00:01:18,870
<c.simplifiedchinese>准备</c.simplifiedchinese>

9
00:01:19,454 --> 00:01:21,456
<c.simplifiedchinese>刽子手拔刀斋</c.simplifiedchinese>

10
00:01:39,724 --> 00:01:43,061
<c.simplifiedchinese>（原作：和月伸宏
集英社《周刊少年JUMP》）</c.simplifiedchinese>

11
00:03:02,974 --> 00:03:05,393
<c.simplifiedchinese>（明治十一年 东京下町）</c.simplifiedchinese>

12
00:03:06,936 --> 00:03:08,479
<c.simplifiedchinese>刽子手拔刀斋！</c.simplifiedchinese>

13
00:03:10,607 --> 00:03:11,816
<c.simplifiedchinese>终于找到你了</c.simplifiedchinese>

14
00:03:12,609 --> 00:03:14,694
<c.simplifiedchinese>你的杀戮狂欢今晚就要结束了</c.simplifiedchinese>

15
00:03:14,777 --> 00:03:15,778
<c.simplifiedchinese>准备！</c.simplifiedchinese>

16
00:03:15,862 --> 00:03:16,821
<c.simplifiedchinese>哦啰？</c.simplifiedchinese>

17
00:03:16,905 --> 00:03:17,947
<c.simplifiedchinese>不要给我装傻</c.simplifiedchinese>

18
00:03:18,031 --> 00:03:22,160
<c.simplifiedchinese>除了你还有谁会违反规定
在大半夜带着剑四处晃？</c.simplifiedchinese>

19
00:03:25,121 --> 00:03:25,997
<c.simplifiedchinese>等…</c.simplifiedchinese>

20
00:03:30,418 --> 00:03:31,878
<c.simplifiedchinese>好疼…</c.simplifiedchinese>

21
00:03:32,378 --> 00:03:33,546
<c.simplifiedchinese>他太弱了</c.simplifiedchinese>

22
00:03:34,130 --> 00:03:36,174
<c.simplifiedchinese>他真的是那个刽子手拔刀斋吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

23
00:03:36,674 --> 00:03:37,926
<c.simplifiedchinese>浪客</c.simplifiedchinese>

24
00:03:39,552 --> 00:03:41,346
<c.simplifiedchinese>在下是一名浪客</c.simplifiedchinese>

25
00:03:41,429 --> 00:03:44,265
<c.simplifiedchinese>没有特定目的地、四处旅行的剑客</c.simplifiedchinese>

26
00:03:44,349 --> 00:03:46,517
<c.simplifiedchinese>在下刚到这个小镇</c.simplifiedchinese>

27
00:03:46,601 --> 00:03:49,229
<c.simplifiedchinese>所以不是很明白
你说的杀戮是什么意思</c.simplifiedchinese>

28
00:03:49,312 --> 00:03:50,897
<c.simplifiedchinese>那这把剑你怎么解释？</c.simplifiedchinese>

29
00:03:50,980 --> 00:03:53,942
<c.simplifiedchinese>不是说你是剑客就可以随意佩剑！</c.simplifiedchinese>

30
00:03:59,614 --> 00:04:00,657
<c.simplifiedchinese>这是什么？</c.simplifiedchinese>

31
00:04:01,324 --> 00:04:02,367
<c.simplifiedchinese>逆刃刀？</c.simplifiedchinese>

32
00:04:02,867 --> 00:04:05,662
<c.simplifiedchinese>你觉得这把剑能砍伤人吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

33
00:04:06,788 --> 00:04:08,331
<c.simplifiedchinese>不能</c.simplifiedchinese>

34
00:04:08,831 --> 00:04:12,043
<c.simplifiedchinese>这把剑不仅没有磨损</c.simplifiedchinese>

35
00:04:12,126 --> 00:04:14,462
<c.simplifiedchinese>而且没有一丝血迹</c.simplifiedchinese>

36
00:04:14,545 --> 00:04:16,589
<c.simplifiedchinese>和新的一样</c.simplifiedchinese>

37
00:04:17,715 --> 00:04:20,218
<c.simplifiedchinese>那你真的只是一名…</c.simplifiedchinese>

38
00:04:20,301 --> 00:04:22,053
<c.simplifiedchinese>一名浪客</c.simplifiedchinese>

39
00:04:22,136 --> 00:04:24,722
<c.simplifiedchinese>但你为什么带一把
自己用不了的剑呢？</c.simplifiedchinese>

40
00:04:26,391 --> 00:04:27,225
<c.simplifiedchinese>警察！</c.simplifiedchinese>

41
00:04:27,308 --> 00:04:28,810
<c.simplifiedchinese>-我要走了！
-哇！</c.simplifiedchinese>

42
00:04:33,314 --> 00:04:36,818
<c.simplifiedchinese>看来出事了</c.simplifiedchinese>

43
00:04:38,528 --> 00:04:39,696
<c.simplifiedchinese>太弱了！</c.simplifiedchinese>

44
00:04:39,779 --> 00:04:42,532
<c.simplifiedchinese>太弱了！</c.simplifiedchinese>

45
00:04:42,615 --> 00:04:44,742
<c.simplifiedchinese>你们这些懒汉太弱了！</c.simplifiedchinese>

46
00:04:45,743 --> 00:04:48,955
<c.simplifiedchinese>他好厉害 这样的实力莫非是</c.simplifiedchinese>

47
00:04:49,038 --> 00:04:52,417
<c.simplifiedchinese>大名鼎鼎的拔刀斋！</c.simplifiedchinese>

48
00:04:53,751 --> 00:04:55,211
<c.simplifiedchinese>等一下 拔刀斋！</c.simplifiedchinese>

49
00:05:02,218 --> 00:05:03,219
<c.simplifiedchinese>该死…</c.simplifiedchinese>

50
00:05:10,059 --> 00:05:12,270
<c.simplifiedchinese>你好鲁莽</c.simplifiedchinese>

51
00:05:12,353 --> 00:05:13,187
<c.simplifiedchinese>浪客</c.simplifiedchinese>

52
00:05:19,193 --> 00:05:22,196
<c.simplifiedchinese>那强盗在这！</c.simplifiedchinese>

53
00:05:24,032 --> 00:05:25,408
<c.simplifiedchinese>我是拔刀斋！</c.simplifiedchinese>

54
00:05:25,992 --> 00:05:29,037
<c.simplifiedchinese>“神谷活心流”的绯村拔刀斋！</c.simplifiedchinese>

55
00:05:29,120 --> 00:05:32,165
<c.simplifiedchinese>人称“刽子手拔刀斋”！</c.simplifiedchinese>

56
00:05:32,248 --> 00:05:33,082
<c.simplifiedchinese>站住！</c.simplifiedchinese>

57
00:05:34,042 --> 00:05:35,710
<c.simplifiedchinese>等一下 你在干什么？</c.simplifiedchinese>

58
00:05:35,793 --> 00:05:36,961
<c.simplifiedchinese>放我下来！</c.simplifiedchinese>

59
00:05:37,045 --> 00:05:39,630
<c.simplifiedchinese>负伤追人等于自杀</c.simplifiedchinese>

60
00:05:40,131 --> 00:05:43,217
<c.simplifiedchinese>敌人已经声明流派了 不必着急…</c.simplifiedchinese>

61
00:05:43,301 --> 00:05:45,636
<c.simplifiedchinese>神谷活心流是我的流派！</c.simplifiedchinese>

62
00:05:45,720 --> 00:05:49,307
<c.simplifiedchinese>他一直在以我们的名义
犯下这些暴行！</c.simplifiedchinese>

63
00:05:49,807 --> 00:05:50,850
<c.simplifiedchinese>放我下来！</c.simplifiedchinese>

64
00:05:50,933 --> 00:05:52,935
<c.simplifiedchinese>现在追上他还来得及！</c.simplifiedchinese>

65
00:05:53,019 --> 00:05:55,063
<c.simplifiedchinese>追不上他了</c.simplifiedchinese>

66
00:05:55,146 --> 00:05:58,649
<c.simplifiedchinese>在警察问我们之前 赶紧离开吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

67
00:05:58,733 --> 00:06:00,860
<c.simplifiedchinese>放我下来！</c.simplifiedchinese>

68
00:06:03,321 --> 00:06:05,198
<c.simplifiedchinese>（神谷活心流）</c.simplifiedchinese>

69
00:06:06,240 --> 00:06:08,409
<c.simplifiedchinese>神谷活心流</c.simplifiedchinese>

70
00:06:10,870 --> 00:06:13,790
<c.simplifiedchinese>代理师父神谷薰</c.simplifiedchinese>

71
00:06:13,873 --> 00:06:15,041
<c.simplifiedchinese>徒弟…</c.simplifiedchinese>

72
00:06:15,124 --> 00:06:16,209
<c.simplifiedchinese>（徒弟）</c.simplifiedchinese>

73
00:06:16,292 --> 00:06:17,126
<c.simplifiedchinese>哦啰？</c.simplifiedchinese>

74
00:06:17,794 --> 00:06:19,796
<c.simplifiedchinese>我们曾是小型道场</c.simplifiedchinese>

75
00:06:20,797 --> 00:06:25,343
<c.simplifiedchinese>但拥有十名优秀的徒弟
个个都刻苦训练</c.simplifiedchinese>

76
00:06:25,968 --> 00:06:27,303
<c.simplifiedchinese>但两个月前</c.simplifiedchinese>

77
00:06:27,386 --> 00:06:31,599
<c.simplifiedchinese>发生了那场谋杀 就变成现在这样了</c.simplifiedchinese>

78
00:06:32,100 --> 00:06:35,645
<c.simplifiedchinese>因为害怕“拔刀斋”的名声
我的徒弟都走了</c.simplifiedchinese>

79
00:06:35,728 --> 00:06:39,440
<c.simplifiedchinese>小镇上的人都不想接近这家道场</c.simplifiedchinese>

80
00:06:39,941 --> 00:06:45,363
<c.simplifiedchinese>刽子手拔刀斋很可怕
即使身处明治时代</c.simplifiedchinese>

81
00:06:46,364 --> 00:06:49,117
<c.simplifiedchinese>我不知道他为什么
用神谷活心流来行骗</c.simplifiedchinese>

82
00:06:49,200 --> 00:06:52,620
<c.simplifiedchinese>不知道他是不是真的拔刀斋</c.simplifiedchinese>

83
00:06:52,703 --> 00:06:56,249
<c.simplifiedchinese>但我们要尽快结束他的暴行</c.simplifiedchinese>

84
00:06:57,750 --> 00:06:58,876
<c.simplifiedchinese>原来如此</c.simplifiedchinese>

85
00:06:59,794 --> 00:07:03,464
<c.simplifiedchinese>但你不要在夜间巡逻了</c.simplifiedchinese>

86
00:07:03,548 --> 00:07:04,382
<c.simplifiedchinese>嗯？</c.simplifiedchinese>

87
00:07:04,465 --> 00:07:07,260
<c.simplifiedchinese>他比你强多了 薰女士</c.simplifiedchinese>

88
00:07:07,343 --> 00:07:08,177
<c.simplifiedchinese>什么？</c.simplifiedchinese>

89
00:07:08,261 --> 00:07:12,849
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑客要知己知彼</c.simplifiedchinese>

90
00:07:12,932 --> 00:07:16,894
<c.simplifiedchinese>你要知道下次面对他时会发生什么</c.simplifiedchinese>

91
00:07:16,978 --> 00:07:21,858
<c.simplifiedchinese>用你的命来换门派的声望不值得</c.simplifiedchinese>

92
00:07:24,861 --> 00:07:26,696
<c.simplifiedchinese>神谷活心流…</c.simplifiedchinese>

93
00:07:28,197 --> 00:07:31,534
<c.simplifiedchinese>神谷活心流是我父亲创立的</c.simplifiedchinese>

94
00:07:31,617 --> 00:07:35,204
<c.simplifiedchinese>他熬过了幕府末年的暴乱</c.simplifiedchinese>

95
00:07:36,038 --> 00:07:38,541
<c.simplifiedchinese>我父亲拒绝接受
杀人剑的“杀人”理念</c.simplifiedchinese>

96
00:07:38,624 --> 00:07:41,043
<c.simplifiedchinese>花了十年时间开创了</c.simplifiedchinese>

97
00:07:41,127 --> 00:07:44,547
<c.simplifiedchinese>基于活人剑的“救人”流派</c.simplifiedchinese>

98
00:07:44,630 --> 00:07:46,549
<c.simplifiedchinese>但是就连我父亲</c.simplifiedchinese>

99
00:07:46,632 --> 00:07:52,054
<c.simplifiedchinese>六个月前被警视厅拔刀队
抽调去参加西南战争</c.simplifiedchinese>

100
00:07:52,138 --> 00:07:57,393
<c.simplifiedchinese>违背自己的意愿离开了这个世界</c.simplifiedchinese>

101
00:07:58,394 --> 00:08:01,063
<c.simplifiedchinese>自称刽子手拔刀斋的家伙</c.simplifiedchinese>

102
00:08:01,147 --> 00:08:06,110
<c.simplifiedchinese>已经以我们的名义杀了十个人了</c.simplifiedchinese>

103
00:08:07,236 --> 00:08:09,155
<c.simplifiedchinese>我父亲把流派交给我</c.simplifiedchinese>

104
00:08:09,238 --> 00:08:12,241
<c.simplifiedchinese>为了救人的流派</c.simplifiedchinese>

105
00:08:12,325 --> 00:08:14,243
<c.simplifiedchinese>现在被一名杀人犯玷污了！</c.simplifiedchinese>

106
00:08:14,994 --> 00:08:18,956
<c.simplifiedchinese>我不指望一名浪客能理解这种屈辱！</c.simplifiedchinese>

107
00:08:26,297 --> 00:08:27,131
<c.simplifiedchinese>但是</c.simplifiedchinese>

108
00:08:27,215 --> 00:08:31,302
<c.simplifiedchinese>不管怎么样
用那只手臂守夜是不可能的</c.simplifiedchinese>

109
00:08:32,261 --> 00:08:34,472
<c.simplifiedchinese>现在对你来说
最佳的做法就是稍作休息</c.simplifiedchinese>

110
00:08:35,181 --> 00:08:38,476
<c.simplifiedchinese>你真的信奉活人剑的话</c.simplifiedchinese>

111
00:08:38,559 --> 00:08:42,271
<c.simplifiedchinese>就有义务让自己活下去</c.simplifiedchinese>

112
00:08:43,272 --> 00:08:44,106
<c.simplifiedchinese>而且…</c.simplifiedchinese>

113
00:08:45,233 --> 00:08:49,445
<c.simplifiedchinese>尊父一定也不想</c.simplifiedchinese>

114
00:08:49,529 --> 00:08:52,573
<c.simplifiedchinese>让你为了保护流派而牺牲</c.simplifiedchinese>

115
00:08:53,783 --> 00:08:54,742
<c.simplifiedchinese>抱歉</c.simplifiedchinese>

116
00:08:57,119 --> 00:08:59,372
<c.simplifiedchinese>好了 可以了</c.simplifiedchinese>

117
00:08:59,455 --> 00:09:00,998
<c.simplifiedchinese>谢谢你 喜兵卫</c.simplifiedchinese>

118
00:09:01,082 --> 00:09:05,670
<c.simplifiedchinese>薰小姐 别被他这种人影响你了</c.simplifiedchinese>

119
00:09:05,753 --> 00:09:09,215
<c.simplifiedchinese>浪客只是被生活遗弃的人</c.simplifiedchinese>

120
00:09:09,799 --> 00:09:10,633
<c.simplifiedchinese>对</c.simplifiedchinese>

121
00:09:10,716 --> 00:09:14,053
<c.simplifiedchinese>你太善良了 薰小姐</c.simplifiedchinese>

122
00:09:15,721 --> 00:09:16,639
<c.simplifiedchinese>我知道</c.simplifiedchinese>

123
00:09:20,017 --> 00:09:21,602
<c.simplifiedchinese>我心知肚明</c.simplifiedchinese>

124
00:09:26,065 --> 00:09:28,192
<c.simplifiedchinese>（几天后）</c.simplifiedchinese>

125
00:09:30,778 --> 00:09:32,029
<c.simplifiedchinese>喂 站住！</c.simplifiedchinese>

126
00:09:32,113 --> 00:09:32,947
<c.simplifiedchinese>不要动！</c.simplifiedchinese>

127
00:09:33,030 --> 00:09:35,324
<c.simplifiedchinese>噢 他们抓人了吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

128
00:09:39,370 --> 00:09:40,746
<c.simplifiedchinese>哦啰啰…</c.simplifiedchinese>

129
00:09:40,830 --> 00:09:42,248
<c.simplifiedchinese>浪客！</c.simplifiedchinese>

130
00:09:42,832 --> 00:09:44,709
<c.simplifiedchinese>他干什么了？</c.simplifiedchinese>

131
00:09:45,543 --> 00:09:48,254
<c.simplifiedchinese>你也看到了 违反废刀令</c.simplifiedchinese>

132
00:09:48,337 --> 00:09:49,213
<c.simplifiedchinese>嗯？</c.simplifiedchinese>

133
00:09:49,297 --> 00:09:50,423
<c.simplifiedchinese>你看着好眼熟</c.simplifiedchinese>

134
00:09:50,506 --> 00:09:52,883
<c.simplifiedchinese>你是刽子手拔刀斋那个道场的</c.simplifiedchinese>

135
00:09:52,967 --> 00:09:55,052
<c.simplifiedchinese>我说了那是虚假指控！</c.simplifiedchinese>

136
00:09:55,136 --> 00:09:56,178
<c.simplifiedchinese>你以为你在和谁说话！</c.simplifiedchinese>

137
00:09:56,262 --> 00:09:57,346
<c.simplifiedchinese>你想顶撞警官吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

138
00:09:57,430 --> 00:09:59,473
<c.simplifiedchinese>不要炫耀自己的警官头衔了！</c.simplifiedchinese>

139
00:09:59,557 --> 00:10:00,933
<c.simplifiedchinese>-你说什么！
-好吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

140
00:10:01,017 --> 00:10:02,685
<c.simplifiedchinese>别太生气了</c.simplifiedchinese>

141
00:10:02,768 --> 00:10:05,271
<c.simplifiedchinese>冷静点</c.simplifiedchinese>

142
00:10:07,523 --> 00:10:08,357
<c.simplifiedchinese>喂</c.simplifiedchinese>

143
00:10:10,443 --> 00:10:12,570
<c.simplifiedchinese>这次先放你走
但别想着还有下一次机会</c.simplifiedchinese>

144
00:10:12,653 --> 00:10:15,031
<c.simplifiedchinese>你要感谢那个老头子</c.simplifiedchinese>

145
00:10:15,114 --> 00:10:16,240
<c.simplifiedchinese>咧！</c.simplifiedchinese>

146
00:10:17,617 --> 00:10:19,619
<c.simplifiedchinese>谢谢你们出手相救</c.simplifiedchinese>

147
00:10:19,702 --> 00:10:21,537
<c.simplifiedchinese>不客气</c.simplifiedchinese>

148
00:10:21,621 --> 00:10:22,830
<c.simplifiedchinese>你…</c.simplifiedchinese>

149
00:10:22,913 --> 00:10:24,915
<c.simplifiedchinese>还没离开小镇吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

150
00:10:24,999 --> 00:10:26,667
<c.simplifiedchinese>你在这有事吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

151
00:10:26,751 --> 00:10:28,753
<c.simplifiedchinese>没 没什么事</c.simplifiedchinese>

152
00:10:29,378 --> 00:10:32,840
<c.simplifiedchinese>对了 追捕杀人犯有什么消息吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

153
00:10:32,923 --> 00:10:33,758
<c.simplifiedchinese>嗯</c.simplifiedchinese>

154
00:10:33,841 --> 00:10:36,385
<c.simplifiedchinese>确实遇到一个疑似杀人犯的人</c.simplifiedchinese>

155
00:10:36,469 --> 00:10:39,388
<c.simplifiedchinese>隔壁小镇有一家道场</c.simplifiedchinese>

156
00:10:39,472 --> 00:10:40,306
<c.simplifiedchinese>这样</c.simplifiedchinese>

157
00:10:40,389 --> 00:10:42,808
<c.simplifiedchinese>但更像是曾经是一家道场</c.simplifiedchinese>

158
00:10:42,892 --> 00:10:45,770
<c.simplifiedchinese>现在变成赌徒和流氓混迹的场所了</c.simplifiedchinese>

159
00:10:45,853 --> 00:10:47,688
<c.simplifiedchinese>两个月前</c.simplifiedchinese>

160
00:10:47,772 --> 00:10:50,733
<c.simplifiedchinese>有一位武士队的剑客
开始接管那个地方</c.simplifiedchinese>

161
00:10:50,816 --> 00:10:55,029
<c.simplifiedchinese>据说 他是一米九七的巨人</c.simplifiedchinese>

162
00:10:55,112 --> 00:10:57,073
<c.simplifiedchinese>听起来不是很怪吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

163
00:10:57,156 --> 00:10:59,700
<c.simplifiedchinese>两个月前正是谋杀开始的时候</c.simplifiedchinese>

164
00:10:59,784 --> 00:11:01,869
<c.simplifiedchinese>而且他也很高</c.simplifiedchinese>

165
00:11:01,952 --> 00:11:04,622
<c.simplifiedchinese>很少有那么高的人符合这些描述了</c.simplifiedchinese>

166
00:11:04,705 --> 00:11:09,210
<c.simplifiedchinese>薰小姐 我要准备晚餐了 先走了</c.simplifiedchinese>

167
00:11:09,293 --> 00:11:12,296
<c.simplifiedchinese>-噢 好 麻烦了
-失陪</c.simplifiedchinese>

168
00:11:15,466 --> 00:11:17,385
<c.simplifiedchinese>他是你什么人？</c.simplifiedchinese>

169
00:11:17,468 --> 00:11:18,386
<c.simplifiedchinese>噢 喜兵卫？</c.simplifiedchinese>

170
00:11:18,469 --> 00:11:20,930
<c.simplifiedchinese>算是管家吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

171
00:11:21,013 --> 00:11:23,307
<c.simplifiedchinese>就在我父亲去世前后</c.simplifiedchinese>

172
00:11:23,808 --> 00:11:27,436
<c.simplifiedchinese>他病倒在道场门外 我救了他</c.simplifiedchinese>

173
00:11:27,520 --> 00:11:29,730
<c.simplifiedchinese>他很担心我</c.simplifiedchinese>

174
00:11:29,814 --> 00:11:32,942
<c.simplifiedchinese>叫我把道场卖了
到其他地方安静地生活</c.simplifiedchinese>

175
00:11:33,025 --> 00:11:33,984
<c.simplifiedchinese>他是哪里人？</c.simplifiedchinese>

176
00:11:34,068 --> 00:11:35,444
<c.simplifiedchinese>我没问过他 我也不知道</c.simplifiedchinese>

177
00:11:35,528 --> 00:11:37,238
<c.simplifiedchinese>你很容易相信别人</c.simplifiedchinese>

178
00:11:37,321 --> 00:11:38,489
<c.simplifiedchinese>是吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

179
00:11:39,532 --> 00:11:40,616
<c.simplifiedchinese>没事</c.simplifiedchinese>

180
00:11:40,699 --> 00:11:45,454
<c.simplifiedchinese>每个人都有一两件不想谈论的往事</c.simplifiedchinese>

181
00:11:45,538 --> 00:11:47,415
<c.simplifiedchinese>你不也是吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

182
00:11:47,498 --> 00:11:49,667
<c.simplifiedchinese>你不也是因为这样才做浪客的吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

183
00:11:54,171 --> 00:11:55,881
<c.simplifiedchinese>没错</c.simplifiedchinese>

184
00:11:55,965 --> 00:11:57,466
<c.simplifiedchinese>有了！</c.simplifiedchinese>

185
00:11:57,550 --> 00:11:59,343
<c.simplifiedchinese>反正你也没钱寄宿 对吧？</c.simplifiedchinese>

186
00:11:59,427 --> 00:12:00,761
<c.simplifiedchinese>要不住我家吧？</c.simplifiedchinese>

187
00:12:00,845 --> 00:12:04,390
<c.simplifiedchinese>在下还有些事要处理 下次吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

188
00:12:05,641 --> 00:12:06,600
<c.simplifiedchinese>噢 等下</c.simplifiedchinese>

189
00:12:07,643 --> 00:12:08,727
<c.simplifiedchinese>还有什么事吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

190
00:12:09,603 --> 00:12:10,646
<c.simplifiedchinese>呃…</c.simplifiedchinese>

191
00:12:11,147 --> 00:12:13,691
<c.simplifiedchinese>这个…那天…</c.simplifiedchinese>

192
00:12:13,774 --> 00:12:18,237
<c.simplifiedchinese>我还没有感谢你救了我
还骂了你一通</c.simplifiedchinese>

193
00:12:18,320 --> 00:12:19,155
<c.simplifiedchinese>呃…</c.simplifiedchinese>

194
00:12:19,905 --> 00:12:20,739
<c.simplifiedchinese>这个…</c.simplifiedchinese>

195
00:12:22,408 --> 00:12:23,534
<c.simplifiedchinese>对不起</c.simplifiedchinese>

196
00:12:24,118 --> 00:12:26,162
<c.simplifiedchinese>你发烧了吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

197
00:12:26,245 --> 00:12:28,664
<c.simplifiedchinese>亏我还在向你道歉呢！</c.simplifiedchinese>

198
00:12:28,747 --> 00:12:30,583
<c.simplifiedchinese>啊…你说的对</c.simplifiedchinese>

199
00:12:31,542 --> 00:12:35,254
<c.simplifiedchinese>没事 浪客不拘小节</c.simplifiedchinese>

200
00:12:35,337 --> 00:12:38,257
<c.simplifiedchinese>薰女士也不要担心</c.simplifiedchinese>

201
00:12:41,469 --> 00:12:44,430
<c.simplifiedchinese>但是 他要处理什么事呢？</c.simplifiedchinese>

202
00:12:46,390 --> 00:12:48,642
<c.simplifiedchinese>隔壁小镇的道场…</c.simplifiedchinese>

203
00:12:49,894 --> 00:12:53,689
<c.simplifiedchinese>难怪我在这个小镇怎么找也找不到他</c.simplifiedchinese>

204
00:12:56,275 --> 00:12:58,736
<c.simplifiedchinese>打扰一下！</c.simplifiedchinese>

205
00:12:58,819 --> 00:13:01,405
<c.simplifiedchinese>打扰一下 打扰…</c.simplifiedchinese>

206
00:13:01,489 --> 00:13:03,866
<c.simplifiedchinese>闭嘴！你到底是谁？</c.simplifiedchinese>

207
00:13:03,949 --> 00:13:05,326
<c.simplifiedchinese>是老师？</c.simplifiedchinese>

208
00:13:05,409 --> 00:13:08,496
<c.simplifiedchinese>比留间老师出去了！下次再来吧！</c.simplifiedchinese>

209
00:13:09,079 --> 00:13:12,208
<c.simplifiedchinese>噢 姓比留间啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

210
00:13:12,291 --> 00:13:14,710
<c.simplifiedchinese>你来的时候不知道？</c.simplifiedchinese>

211
00:13:14,793 --> 00:13:16,921
<c.simplifiedchinese>我以为他的名字是</c.simplifiedchinese>

212
00:13:17,796 --> 00:13:20,382
<c.simplifiedchinese>“街头杀手拔刀斋”</c.simplifiedchinese>

213
00:13:22,426 --> 00:13:25,554
<c.simplifiedchinese>看来薰女士的怀疑是对的</c.simplifiedchinese>

214
00:13:25,638 --> 00:13:27,473
<c.simplifiedchinese>怎么了 西胁先生？</c.simplifiedchinese>

215
00:13:28,432 --> 00:13:30,518
<c.simplifiedchinese>这小矮人是谁？</c.simplifiedchinese>

216
00:13:30,601 --> 00:13:33,229
<c.simplifiedchinese>没事 他就是个臭小子</c.simplifiedchinese>

217
00:13:35,064 --> 00:13:37,191
<c.simplifiedchinese>解决他</c.simplifiedchinese>

218
00:13:38,192 --> 00:13:40,319
<c.simplifiedchinese>不好了 它自己裂开了</c.simplifiedchinese>

219
00:13:41,820 --> 00:13:43,030
<c.simplifiedchinese>薰小姐</c.simplifiedchinese>

220
00:13:43,614 --> 00:13:46,659
<c.simplifiedchinese>喜兵卫 有事吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

221
00:13:46,742 --> 00:13:49,286
<c.simplifiedchinese>转手道场的事</c.simplifiedchinese>

222
00:13:49,370 --> 00:13:50,454
<c.simplifiedchinese>嗯？</c.simplifiedchinese>

223
00:13:50,538 --> 00:13:53,332
<c.simplifiedchinese>之前和你说过 我不打算卖掉道场</c.simplifiedchinese>

224
00:13:53,415 --> 00:13:55,251
<c.simplifiedchinese>但你也看到了</c.simplifiedchinese>

225
00:13:56,043 --> 00:13:58,462
<c.simplifiedchinese>所有文件都准备好了</c.simplifiedchinese>

226
00:13:59,463 --> 00:14:00,506
<c.simplifiedchinese>喜兵卫？</c.simplifiedchinese>

227
00:14:00,589 --> 00:14:03,300
<c.simplifiedchinese>只差你的手印了</c.simplifiedchinese>

228
00:14:03,968 --> 00:14:08,013
<c.simplifiedchinese>然后这里就属于我们了</c.simplifiedchinese>

229
00:14:10,516 --> 00:14:11,350
<c.simplifiedchinese>你好啊！</c.simplifiedchinese>

230
00:14:12,476 --> 00:14:13,310
<c.simplifiedchinese>是你！</c.simplifiedchinese>

231
00:14:14,228 --> 00:14:17,773
<c.simplifiedchinese>比留间伍兵卫 我的弟弟</c.simplifiedchinese>

232
00:14:19,775 --> 00:14:21,819
<c.simplifiedchinese>我也不想这样</c.simplifiedchinese>

233
00:14:21,902 --> 00:14:24,196
<c.simplifiedchinese>我也想合法购买</c.simplifiedchinese>

234
00:14:24,280 --> 00:14:28,659
<c.simplifiedchinese>但现在你知道我弟弟是谁了
我不能再冒险了</c.simplifiedchinese>

235
00:14:28,742 --> 00:14:33,455
<c.simplifiedchinese>扮演友好的老头来获得信任
是计划的一部分</c.simplifiedchinese>

236
00:14:33,539 --> 00:14:38,043
<c.simplifiedchinese>你是热心肠的人
但一提到剑术就变得很固执</c.simplifiedchinese>

237
00:14:38,127 --> 00:14:44,133
<c.simplifiedchinese>所以我让弟弟行凶来损害道场名誉</c.simplifiedchinese>

238
00:14:44,216 --> 00:14:47,720
<c.simplifiedchinese>刽子手拔刀斋的名号也很奏效</c.simplifiedchinese>

239
00:14:47,803 --> 00:14:51,724
<c.simplifiedchinese>尽管有没有这么一号人也值得怀疑</c.simplifiedchinese>

240
00:14:51,807 --> 00:14:55,311
<c.simplifiedchinese>多亏了这个名号
短短两月 我们就走到这一步了</c.simplifiedchinese>

241
00:14:55,895 --> 00:14:58,188
<c.simplifiedchinese>据我估计 政府的“明治维新”政策</c.simplifiedchinese>

242
00:14:58,272 --> 00:15:00,566
<c.simplifiedchinese>可以让这片土地的价值增长五、六倍</c.simplifiedchinese>

243
00:15:00,649 --> 00:15:03,611
<c.simplifiedchinese>只是用作道场的话就太浪费了</c.simplifiedchinese>

244
00:15:03,694 --> 00:15:05,237
<c.simplifiedchinese>喜兵卫…</c.simplifiedchinese>

245
00:15:05,321 --> 00:15:07,823
<c.simplifiedchinese>我听哥哥说</c.simplifiedchinese>

246
00:15:07,907 --> 00:15:11,827
<c.simplifiedchinese>“用剑不是为了杀人 而是救人”
是你的座右铭</c.simplifiedchinese>

247
00:15:11,911 --> 00:15:13,037
<c.simplifiedchinese>有意思</c.simplifiedchinese>

248
00:15:13,120 --> 00:15:16,123
<c.simplifiedchinese>救下自己的命怎么样？</c.simplifiedchinese>

249
00:15:19,877 --> 00:15:20,961
<c.simplifiedchinese>不出我所料</c.simplifiedchinese>

250
00:15:21,045 --> 00:15:24,214
<c.simplifiedchinese>有这种理念的女人是打不了架的</c.simplifiedchinese>

251
00:15:30,179 --> 00:15:33,307
<c.simplifiedchinese>目标是暴力 本质是杀戮！</c.simplifiedchinese>

252
00:15:33,390 --> 00:15:35,809
<c.simplifiedchinese>这才是剑的用途！</c.simplifiedchinese>

253
00:15:37,186 --> 00:15:40,314
<c.simplifiedchinese>这个地方现在是我们的了</c.simplifiedchinese>

254
00:15:41,231 --> 00:15:44,068
<c.simplifiedchinese>神谷活心流的时代结束了</c.simplifiedchinese>

255
00:15:44,693 --> 00:15:45,527
<c.simplifiedchinese>啊？</c.simplifiedchinese>

256
00:15:45,611 --> 00:15:46,528
<c.simplifiedchinese>嗯？</c.simplifiedchinese>

257
00:15:46,612 --> 00:15:48,572
<c.simplifiedchinese>怎么了 西胁？</c.simplifiedchinese>

258
00:15:49,615 --> 00:15:52,201
<c.simplifiedchinese>太…厉害了</c.simplifiedchinese>

259
00:15:54,578 --> 00:15:56,246
<c.simplifiedchinese>浪…浪客！</c.simplifiedchinese>

260
00:15:56,830 --> 00:15:58,165
<c.simplifiedchinese>抱歉 来晚了</c.simplifiedchinese>

261
00:15:58,666 --> 00:16:00,501
<c.simplifiedchinese>在下了解全貌了</c.simplifiedchinese>

262
00:16:01,502 --> 00:16:03,128
<c.simplifiedchinese>又是你</c.simplifiedchinese>

263
00:16:03,212 --> 00:16:05,547
<c.simplifiedchinese>你也和这小妞一样</c.simplifiedchinese>

264
00:16:05,631 --> 00:16:08,926
<c.simplifiedchinese>觉得剑可以救人吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

265
00:16:09,009 --> 00:16:09,927
<c.simplifiedchinese>不是</c.simplifiedchinese>

266
00:16:10,928 --> 00:16:12,471
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑是武器</c.simplifiedchinese>

267
00:16:12,554 --> 00:16:14,932
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑术是杀人的艺术</c.simplifiedchinese>

268
00:16:15,015 --> 00:16:19,853
<c.simplifiedchinese>不管用什么干净的字眼
那都是终极真理</c.simplifiedchinese>

269
00:16:22,398 --> 00:16:24,775
<c.simplifiedchinese>薰女士说的</c.simplifiedchinese>

270
00:16:24,858 --> 00:16:30,572
<c.simplifiedchinese>是双手从未沾染过鲜血的人说的话</c.simplifiedchinese>

271
00:16:30,656 --> 00:16:32,032
<c.simplifiedchinese>浪客…</c.simplifiedchinese>

272
00:16:32,533 --> 00:16:35,661
<c.simplifiedchinese>但是 比起剑术的真实本质</c.simplifiedchinese>

273
00:16:37,121 --> 00:16:41,000
<c.simplifiedchinese>在下更喜欢薰女士的理念</c.simplifiedchinese>

274
00:16:42,334 --> 00:16:44,253
<c.simplifiedchinese>希望在未来</c.simplifiedchinese>

275
00:16:44,336 --> 00:16:48,257
<c.simplifiedchinese>她的理念会成为真正的本质</c.simplifiedchinese>

276
00:16:48,340 --> 00:16:52,636
<c.simplifiedchinese>哥哥 不介意我杀了他吧？</c.simplifiedchinese>

277
00:16:52,720 --> 00:16:55,723
<c.simplifiedchinese>不介意 往死里揍</c.simplifiedchinese>

278
00:16:55,806 --> 00:16:57,975
<c.simplifiedchinese>-喂 弟兄们！
-是！</c.simplifiedchinese>

279
00:16:58,058 --> 00:16:59,810
<c.simplifiedchinese>浪客 快跑！</c.simplifiedchinese>

280
00:16:59,893 --> 00:17:02,229
<c.simplifiedchinese>在下不想徒增伤亡人数</c.simplifiedchinese>

281
00:17:02,813 --> 00:17:06,775
<c.simplifiedchinese>如果不想看医生的话 就快点退后吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

282
00:17:06,859 --> 00:17:08,610
<c.simplifiedchinese>绝不会有任何伤亡！</c.simplifiedchinese>

283
00:17:08,694 --> 00:17:10,988
<c.simplifiedchinese>只会有你自己的尸体！</c.simplifiedchinese>

284
00:17:16,160 --> 00:17:17,202
<c.simplifiedchinese>什么？</c.simplifiedchinese>

285
00:17:17,286 --> 00:17:19,747
<c.simplifiedchinese>他一剑就扫倒四、五个人了！</c.simplifiedchinese>

286
00:17:19,830 --> 00:17:21,707
<c.simplifiedchinese>这是什么巫术吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

287
00:17:21,790 --> 00:17:24,418
<c.simplifiedchinese>不 这不是巫术</c.simplifiedchinese>

288
00:17:24,501 --> 00:17:25,419
<c.simplifiedchinese>这是…</c.simplifiedchinese>

289
00:17:26,336 --> 00:17:27,629
<c.simplifiedchinese>速度！</c.simplifiedchinese>

290
00:17:27,713 --> 00:17:30,841
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑的速度 他移动的速度</c.simplifiedchinese>

291
00:17:30,924 --> 00:17:33,594
<c.simplifiedchinese>还有判断对手移动方向的速度</c.simplifiedchinese>

292
00:17:34,511 --> 00:17:37,056
<c.simplifiedchinese>他正充分利用自己的速度</c.simplifiedchinese>

293
00:17:37,139 --> 00:17:41,894
<c.simplifiedchinese>用最少的步数同时解决多个对手！</c.simplifiedchinese>

294
00:17:43,062 --> 00:17:45,105
<c.simplifiedchinese>忘记说一件事了</c.simplifiedchinese>

295
00:17:45,689 --> 00:17:49,818
<c.simplifiedchinese>刽子手拔刀斋的真实流派
不是神谷活心流</c.simplifiedchinese>

296
00:17:49,902 --> 00:17:54,073
<c.simplifiedchinese>而是源自战国时代的古流剑术</c.simplifiedchinese>

297
00:17:54,156 --> 00:17:56,784
<c.simplifiedchinese>名字是“飞天御剑流”</c.simplifiedchinese>

298
00:17:57,701 --> 00:18:00,079
<c.simplifiedchinese>特别之处便是
用单手同时击败多个敌人</c.simplifiedchinese>

299
00:18:00,621 --> 00:18:02,623
<c.simplifiedchinese>要不是因为用的是这样的剑</c.simplifiedchinese>

300
00:18:02,706 --> 00:18:04,708
<c.simplifiedchinese>肯定已经有人身亡了</c.simplifiedchinese>

301
00:18:05,209 --> 00:18:08,003
<c.simplifiedchinese>这是高速的杀人剑</c.simplifiedchinese>

302
00:18:08,087 --> 00:18:09,171
<c.simplifiedchinese>难道…</c.simplifiedchinese>

303
00:18:09,254 --> 00:18:11,715
<c.simplifiedchinese>你是真的刽子手拔刀…</c.simplifiedchinese>

304
00:18:11,799 --> 00:18:13,383
<c.simplifiedchinese>听起来真有意思！</c.simplifiedchinese>

305
00:18:13,467 --> 00:18:18,847
<c.simplifiedchinese>上次见面时 还不知道你有这么强</c.simplifiedchinese>

306
00:18:19,723 --> 00:18:22,851
<c.simplifiedchinese>你上次隐藏了实力</c.simplifiedchinese>

307
00:18:22,935 --> 00:18:26,855
<c.simplifiedchinese>不像你 在下不太喜欢暴力行为</c.simplifiedchinese>

308
00:18:26,939 --> 00:18:31,193
<c.simplifiedchinese>但现在 有点后悔没解决你了</c.simplifiedchinese>

309
00:18:31,276 --> 00:18:33,153
<c.simplifiedchinese>我喜欢你的自信</c.simplifiedchinese>

310
00:18:33,237 --> 00:18:36,031
<c.simplifiedchinese>但那其实应该叫自负！</c.simplifiedchinese>

311
00:18:36,115 --> 00:18:39,368
<c.simplifiedchinese>这个世界不需要两个拔刀斋！</c.simplifiedchinese>

312
00:18:42,287 --> 00:18:43,122
<c.simplifiedchinese>这边</c.simplifiedchinese>

313
00:18:52,589 --> 00:18:55,342
<c.simplifiedchinese>虽然对拔刀斋这个头衔没什么感情</c.simplifiedchinese>

314
00:18:55,926 --> 00:18:59,847
<c.simplifiedchinese>但在下不能把它传给你这样的人</c.simplifiedchinese>

315
00:19:01,765 --> 00:19:05,561
<c.simplifiedchinese>别以为你作为主谋就这点惩罚</c.simplifiedchinese>

316
00:19:14,736 --> 00:19:15,863
<c.simplifiedchinese>真是的</c.simplifiedchinese>

317
00:19:15,946 --> 00:19:16,822
<c.simplifiedchinese>（土地产权转让）</c.simplifiedchinese>

318
00:19:16,905 --> 00:19:21,910
<c.simplifiedchinese>那些让别人去送死的人通常都是懦夫</c.simplifiedchinese>

319
00:19:23,745 --> 00:19:26,373
<c.simplifiedchinese>抱歉 薰女士</c.simplifiedchinese>

320
00:19:26,456 --> 00:19:29,877
<c.simplifiedchinese>在下不是有意隐瞒或欺骗你</c.simplifiedchinese>

321
00:19:30,502 --> 00:19:32,004
<c.simplifiedchinese>但可能的话</c.simplifiedchinese>

322
00:19:33,255 --> 00:19:35,340
<c.simplifiedchinese>在下也不想提起</c.simplifiedchinese>

323
00:19:36,633 --> 00:19:38,760
<c.simplifiedchinese>失陪了 保重</c.simplifiedchinese>

324
00:19:39,887 --> 00:19:42,014
<c.simplifiedchinese>等…等一下！</c.simplifiedchinese>

325
00:19:42,097 --> 00:19:45,851
<c.simplifiedchinese>我一个人怎么经营道场？</c.simplifiedchinese>

326
00:19:45,934 --> 00:19:48,395
<c.simplifiedchinese>至少帮下忙呀！</c.simplifiedchinese>

327
00:19:48,478 --> 00:19:51,648
<c.simplifiedchinese>我不在乎别人的过去！</c.simplifiedchinese>

328
00:19:52,983 --> 00:19:54,359
<c.simplifiedchinese>在下不建议你这么做</c.simplifiedchinese>

329
00:19:54,860 --> 00:19:57,196
<c.simplifiedchinese>这是你重振道场辉煌的机会</c.simplifiedchinese>

330
00:19:57,279 --> 00:20:01,200
<c.simplifiedchinese>真正的拔刀斋在的话 就没意义了</c.simplifiedchinese>

331
00:20:01,283 --> 00:20:05,579
<c.simplifiedchinese>我不是叫你作为拔刀斋留下
而是作为浪客留…</c.simplifiedchinese>

332
00:20:07,372 --> 00:20:10,125
<c.simplifiedchinese>好 我明白了 想走就走吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

333
00:20:10,834 --> 00:20:14,838
<c.simplifiedchinese>但至少离开前告诉我你的名字</c.simplifiedchinese>

334
00:20:14,922 --> 00:20:18,592
<c.simplifiedchinese>拔刀斋是很久以前一位爱国者的名号</c.simplifiedchinese>

335
00:20:19,384 --> 00:20:23,889
<c.simplifiedchinese>还是说 你不想告诉我你的真名？</c.simplifiedchinese>

336
00:20:30,103 --> 00:20:31,063
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑心</c.simplifiedchinese>

337
00:20:33,232 --> 00:20:34,733
<c.simplifiedchinese>绯村剑心</c.simplifiedchinese>

338
00:20:35,609 --> 00:20:38,237
<c.simplifiedchinese>这是在下现在的名字</c.simplifiedchinese>

339
00:20:38,737 --> 00:20:41,531
<c.simplifiedchinese>毕竟流浪了这么久 在下也累了</c.simplifiedchinese>

340
00:20:42,032 --> 00:20:46,036
<c.simplifiedchinese>在下是浪客
所以可能又要开始浪迹天涯了</c.simplifiedchinese>

341
00:20:46,119 --> 00:20:47,537
<c.simplifiedchinese>但你没问题的话</c.simplifiedchinese>

342
00:20:48,121 --> 00:20:50,374
<c.simplifiedchinese>在下愿意暂时留下来</c.simplifiedchinese>

343
00:20:53,627 --> 00:20:55,337
<c.simplifiedchinese>明治十一年 东京小镇上</c.simplifiedchinese>

344
00:20:55,420 --> 00:20:59,132
<c.simplifiedchinese>随着浪客绯村剑心的到来</c.simplifiedchinese>

345
00:20:59,633 --> 00:21:03,553
<c.simplifiedchinese>这段浪漫故事开始了</c.simplifiedchinese>

346
00:21:05,514 --> 00:21:06,515
<c.simplifiedchinese>等一下</c.simplifiedchinese>

347
00:21:06,598 --> 00:21:10,352
<c.simplifiedchinese>你是江户末年的武士的话
那你现在多大了？</c.simplifiedchinese>

348
00:21:10,435 --> 00:21:13,563
<c.simplifiedchinese>别告诉我
你看着这么年轻 已经30多了！</c.simplifiedchinese>

349
00:21:13,647 --> 00:21:14,898
<c.simplifiedchinese>哦啰？</c.simplifiedchinese>

350
00:22:47,032 --> 00:22:50,786
<c.simplifiedchinese>下一回 《东京武士族 明神弥彦》</c.simplifiedchinese>

